  - title: 02 / Measure speed
    explanation: Start in open loop. Count valid quadrature transitions to measure
      RPM. Add load and compare speed at the same duty. Release the brake, then select
      closed loop at 30 and 60 RPM.
    caption: "80 COUNTS PER REVOLUTION  \u2022  0.5 SECOND SAMPLE"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
      label: 5 V + RETURN
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
