  - title: 03 / Reject a load change
    explanation: The brake adds torque opposing the motor. Speed falls first. The
      governor increases duty and brings the speed back to the target band.
    caption: "60 RPM  \u2022  TEST LOAD"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
      label: 5 V + RETURN
      color: {r: 0.28, g: 0.69, b: 1, a: 1}
