  - title: 04 / Recover safely
    explanation: Remove W06 while running. The driver opens and the rotor coasts
      down. Restore W06, explicitly reset, and start again in closed loop at 60 RPM.
    caption: "ENCODER B LOST  \u2022  DRIVE DISABLED"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
